Subject: [PATCH 2900/3799] soh: rename func_80B3EEA4 -> EnXc_NextAfterAction30

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: when the shared step has moved the action off 30, forces 31 instead
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index ab0f3611f..02db57849 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1286,7 +1286,8 @@ void EnXc_GoToAction30AfterSerenade(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B3EEA4(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B3EEA4: when the shared step has moved the action off 30, forces 31 instead
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction30(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_30, SHEIK_ACTION_31);
 }
 
@@ -1355,7 +1356,7 @@ void EnXc_Serenade(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc30(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ActionFunc21(this, play);
-    func_80B3EEA4(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction30(this);  // was func_80B3EEA4 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc31(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
